[00:12.14]I’m watchin’ it end
{"我目睹它走向终结"}
[00:15.14]Again and again
{"一次又一次"}
[00:18.38]I feel it in waves you follow me
{"浪潮般感受着你的追随"}
[00:22.06]Drifting to places I should leave
{"漂向本该离开的方位"}
[00:24.34]So close to the edge
{"如此接近临界点"}
[00:27.74]Of something so perfect
{"近乎完美的边缘"}
[00:30.34]We were too scared to take the leap
{"我们却畏惧纵身一跃"}
[00:34.22]I’m missing the way we used to be
{"怀念从前相处的感觉"}
[00:36.82]
[00:37.91]You let me go
{"你放手离去"}
[00:41.56]Left me in this mess I’m falling
{"留我在坠落中沉溺"}
[00:44.62]I’ll never know
{"我永远不明"}
[00:47.81]Can’t find a reason why
{"找不到缘由说明"}
[00:50.25]We can't get any closer
{"为何无法再靠近"}
[00:54.09]Can’t find a reason why
{"找不到缘由说明"}
[00:56.64]We can't get any closer
{"为何无法再靠近"}
