{"我们无法再靠近"}
[01:17.26]
[01:29.01]I try to forget
{"试图抹去回忆"}
[01:30.90]All that we had
{"曾有过的点滴"}
[01:34.43]I’m rolling like water in the sea
{"如海水起伏不息"}
[01:38.13]The memories crashing into me
{"记忆浪潮将我侵袭"}
[01:41.31]So close to the edge
{"如此接近临界点"}
[01:43.76]Of something so worth it
{"值得奔赴的彼岸"}
[01:47.02]You had the world right at your feet
{"世界曾在你脚下铺展"}
[01:50.76]And “almost” is all we’ll ever be
{"而「几乎」就是我们最终的结局"}
[02:06.91](We can’t get any closer)
{"（我们无法再靠近）"}
